  "kDefVargottama": "Janma kundli (D1) aur navansh (D9) dono mein ek hi raashi mein sthit grah — shakti ka prateek.",
  "kDefOwnSign": "Apni khud ki raashi mein baitha grah, jahan wo ghar jaisa mehsoos karta hai aur sthir parinaam deta hai.",
  "kDefExalted": "Apni sarvochcha shakti ki raashi mein sthit grah, jo apne sarvashreshtha parinaam deta hai.",
  "kDefDebilitated": "Apni sabse kamzor raashi mein sthit grah, jahan wo parinaam dene mein sangharsh karta hai.",
  "kDefMooltrikona": "Grah ki apni raashi ka ek vishesh bhaag, jahan wo vishesh roop se shaktishaali hota hai.",
  "kDefAscendant": "Janma ke samay purvi kshitij par udit hone wali raashi — Lagna, kundli ki neenv.",
  "kDefMahadasha": "Jeevan ki ek lambi avadhi ko rang dene wala pramukh grah kaal.",
  "kDefAntardasha": "Mahadasha ke bheetar ek upa-avadhi, jo iske parinaamon ko sookshmata se samayojit karti hai.",
  "kDefPada": "Grah jis nakshatra mein sthit hai, uske chaar charanon mein se ek.",
